{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI in the Anthropocene.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI in the Anthropocene.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai in the anthropocene ai in the anthropocene","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI in the Anthropocene.md","fileName":"AI in the Anthropocene.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI in the Anthropocene","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Labor and Environmental Ethics]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Labor and Environmental Ethics","Sustainable AI","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI in the Anthropocene.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI in the Anthropocene.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai in the anthropocene ai in the anthropocene","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI in the Anthropocene.md","fileName":"AI in the Anthropocene.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI in the Anthropocene","heading":"AI in the Anthropocene","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"AI in the Anthropocene concerns the role of intelligent systems in an era when human activity has become a powerful force shaping Earth's climate and ecosystems. AI can help study complex environmental change, but it can also intensify extraction, energy use, waste, and attempts to manage the planet as a controllable resource.\n\nDelegating environmental management to a supposedly superior machine would not escape human hyper-agency; it could extend it through automated control. The ethical challenge is to use intelligence while recognizing dependence on embodied, social, and ecological relationships. [[Sustainable AI]] must therefore consider nonhuman life and limits, not only human efficiency.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Labor and Environmental Ethics","Sustainable AI","aiethics.